 with the address, background, etc. layered.\n\nReference Materials\nWe would appreciate it if you could refer to a standing picture of the clothes from the URL of the reference material. (We don't have a three-sided drawing yet, so you can just imagine what you can't see!)\nI am an idol-type Vtuber.\n\n\nI am an idol-type Vtuber.\nThumbnails for videos and distribution\nPosting on SNS\nUse as a calendar of images for fan sites to give back.\nWe would be grateful for your permission.\n\nWe understand that you are busy,\nWe would be very grateful if we could have a chance to work with you...!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1fupDdByccmt70SUd8VBYocbg6TS4puIF/view?usp=drivesd", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kLk6emUtFfIhuBB/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 986737, "client_id": 3142126, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7336a1748045eb60a62a641dcbd53cfa", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7336a1748045eb60a62a641dcbd53cfa, https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1be3a6e4c87006cf1004d27495b268c9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c08ed3c050e347399441fdb1b297b8da 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10acfa1bc12c3d8203e465561c9aedf4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10acfa1bc12c3d8203e465561c9aedf4, https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9b9e1292abcd505bc94824ba0b5307e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c78641e/uploads/origins/c9133c72-a2b1-4574-8b89-2d1a013e58c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3b8cff3d8cc3480f7fed10fed240e21 3x"}, "body": "Buddha, sutras and priesthood\n\nHello, my name is Honoka Yokaya, and I am a Vtuber.\nI saw your Skeb on X, and I would love to have you draw my character as well, so I made a new request.\nThank you very much for your consideration!\n\n\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\nIntended use\n(1) Non-profit use (I will not sell goods or the illustrations I received.\n(2) Use in post images on X and use as thumbnails for distribution (Monetization is turned on for distribution.)\n\nCharacter\nName: Honoka Yokaya\nHeight: 162 cm Personality: Energetic Age: Adult\nCharacter Motif / Bear and checkered pattern. Her image color is blue-green (mint, Hatsune Miku's hair color).\nWhen she smiles with her eyes closed, she has a troubled eyebrow.\n\nRequest Details\nI would like you to leave the composition, pose, and situation to me!\n\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could give us a transparent version of the background in addition to the integrated version.\nI would appreciate it if you could give me a transparent version of the background in addition to the integrated version.\nI would appreciate it if you could give me a transparent version of the background as well as an integrated version of the background! \ud83d\ude47\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\n\nWe would appreciate your consideration!\n\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\u2508\n\nCharacter design details\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1nKQmQqdwY2u-tywVFkjodoPHOQeakjh2/view?usp=sharing\nStanding picture (high quality)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/15ubpovN7Zz2H9GAfO4nXSudGDczdUI0p/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kLk6emUtFfIhuBB/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 986737, "client_id": 3269571, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4328cfcd7a7375faa5f66917ba7a93e6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4328cfcd7a7375faa5f66917ba7a93e6, https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a672332b630fcc2cdb24accea86132a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e0229fef2062d95208566898caff56b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b854442eef4919ec104cb1f4e5c794cf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b854442eef4919ec104cb1f4e5c794cf, https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2524a683bce62902978a2d5c5d9fd41f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f079962/uploads/origins/910e2a9f-6599-4757-be49-898409c78f6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71ce5b1dca4af7ba49561ad294b525ff 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Tokito Hakumyo, a member of Re:AcT Gaming, active on Twitch and YouTube.\nI am a member of Re:AcT Gaming and am active on Twitch and YouTube. I saw your illustration and really like the design and paint job, so I would like to make a request for you to draw it!\nUsage\nI would like to use your illustrations in my videos on my monetized channel and in my activities on my TV channel.\nI would like to use your illustration for my activities on my monetized channel.\nRequested contents\nI would like to leave everything to you because I like the pattern and the paint very much!\nI would like you to make another winter-like costume!\nIf the above is too difficult, we will be fine with the costumes shown in the materials!\nIf the above is too difficult for you, you can use the costumes from the reference materials!\n\nWe would appreciate it if the head and other parts of the illustration are not cut off for use in our activities!\n\nWe would like to receive a transparent png or PSD file of the background.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wkqLnDmy5usfQNVEbO3NOsh_vdaMztSl?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kLk6emUtFfIhuBB/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 986737, "client_id": 476330, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e3fb85ace8d13b9c2c513052487fc75", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e3fb85ace8d13b9c2c513052487fc75, https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8b694196b7af08d8f3c00024687e8dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebb923b78bf96339c88989afa7911d82 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b58b29424bc5c77d4fec1124b886e4b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b58b29424bc5c77d4fec1124b886e4b, https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=80ac47e26a1445eed73c11f5cea73617 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5728e56f/uploads/origins/70363c11-937c-4a66-bc69-0ab0f72e14af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9148b397834600277d860052b70b4e94 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would like to request art of my vtuber character! She is a villainess! There are two versions in the drive link, you can choose which one you prefer to draw! One is her villainess form and one is her undercover form. \n\nYou can choose the pose and expression. You can draw her in modern situations as well! I will use the illustration on social media, youtube, and twitch.\n\nAs a Villainess she is cruel, slightly crazy, but still protective of her ruined kingdom and throne. But she can be flustered and shy when she is embarrassed! Sometimes she is a bit silly. She can use shadow magic.\n\nIn her undercover form she is hiding in the modern-day world and enjoys reading villainess isekai comics, drinking coffee, and cooking. She gives off a calm feeling but she's still a villainess at heart!\n\nImportant design notes: She does not have human ears. She does not have a tail.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Gho4ZgPZntzqhR0AgjrJN0g_DXsyUITr?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 98078, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "mafuyu", "screen_name": "mfy_le", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1855959632772239360/sN1UVNX0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/906389707/1703586313/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 63, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 257515, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u3064\u304d\ud83c\udf19", "screen_name": "tsuki_morishima", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1785291139538722816/kkTlUBVO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/937932979589988352/1770023570/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 576850, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\ud83e